{"event": "turn", "session_id": "b92f160cb5c849deb7da63a1bc547680", "sequence": 1, "created_at": "2026-10-16T06:16:49.487191+00:00", "message": "绿茶和红茶在制作工艺上有什么区别？", "resolved_question": "绿茶和红茶在制作工艺上有什么区别？", "context_turns": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "disabled", "config_revision": 3, "compliance_blocked": false, "elapsed_seconds": 15.348, "model_calls": 3, "input_tokens": 5770, "output_tokens": 692, "response": {"answer": "**绿茶与红茶在制作工艺上的核心区别**\n\n- **绿茶**：对鲜叶快速加热以钝化酶活性，之后可能经过揉捻、做形或粉碎、干燥等步骤。关键点是**不经过红茶那种有意的氧化（发酵）处理**。具体加热方式和外形因产地和产品而异。（来源：ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types）\n- **红茶**：在叶片被破坏并接触空气后，进行**酶促氧化**，行业里常把这一步叫做“发酵”，但它与微生物发酵不同。红茶属于有意氧化，而绿茶则几乎不进行有意氧化。（来源：Fermentation: The Key Step in Processing of Black Tea）\n\n**一句话对比**：绿茶靠“杀青”终止氧化，红茶靠“发酵（酶促氧化）”促成氧化，这是两者工艺上最本质的分界。\n\n**补充说明**：茶树品种与茶类是两个概念，同一品种用不同工艺可制成不同茶类，因此工艺对成品类型起决定作用。（来源：Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves）\n\n如需进一步了解具体商品，请告诉我您的口味偏好或预算，我再为您查询实时价格与库存。", "intent": "question_answering", "intents": ["question_answering"], "confidence": null, "intent_source": "rules", "recommendations": [], "knowledge_sources": [{"title": "ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types", "url": "https://www.iso.org/obp/ui?_escaped_fragment_=iso%3Astd%3Aiso%3A20715%3Aed-1%3Av1%3Aen", "year": null}, {"title": "Fermentation: The Key Step in Processing of Black Tea", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/fr/records/6473b0a3542a3f9f03b31231", "year": null}, {"title": "Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/en/records/65dff5d763b8185d9cb04493", "year": null}, {"title": "Tea Board India — Modalities and Scheme Guidelines", "url": "https://www.teaboard.gov.in/pdf/schemes/Modalities_and_scheme_guidelines_12th_Plan.pdf", "year": null}], "memory_used": false, "clarification_required": false, "tasks": [{"id": "s1", "tool": "introduce_tea", "status": "success"}], "task_plan": {"steps":